{"metadata":{"role":"article","modules":[{"name":"YBVRAppleSDK"}],"title":"Inserting Ads","roleHeading":"Article"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/adinsertion"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"major":0,"minor":3},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/AdInsertion","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"seeAlsoSections":[{"generated":true,"anchor":"Guides","identifiers":["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/ContentSwitching","doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SwitchingPlayerMode","doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/Drm"],"title":"Guides"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK"]]},"kind":"article","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Schedule ad breaks against the content timeline and drive your own ad UI."}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"Overview","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", reached through "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/ads","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", inserts ad breaks as HLS"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"interstitials. That has two consequences worth knowing up front:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"No manifest support is needed."}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" The content playlist does not have to carry"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"code":"EXT-X-DATERANGE","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" tags — the cue points come from the schedule you supply."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Resuming is seamless."}],"type":"strong"},{"type":"text","text":" The content item stays buffered across a break, so nothing of the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"content is lost or skipped when an ad plays."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"style":"important","name":"Important","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Ads require the HLS player. Low-latency RTMP streams have no interstitial","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"mechanism, and a schedule set on one is ignored.","type":"text"}]}],"type":"aside"},{"anchor":"Scheduling-Breaks","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Scheduling Breaks"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Build an "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdBreak","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" from a cue point and the creatives to play there, then hand the whole"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"schedule to "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/schedule(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". Each call replaces the previous schedule:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["let breaks = [","    YBVRAdBreak(","        id: \"pre\",","        cue: .preRoll,","        creatives: [YBVRAdCreative(urlString: preRollURL)]","    ),","    YBVRAdBreak(","        id: \"mid-1\",","        cue: .midRoll(120),","        creatives: [","            YBVRAdCreative(urlString: firstInPodURL),","            YBVRAdCreative(urlString: secondInPodURL)","        ],","        skipAfter: 5","    ),","    YBVRAdBreak(","        id: \"post\",","        cue: .postRoll,","        creatives: [YBVRAdCreative(urlString: postRollURL)]","    )","]","","player.ads.schedule(breaks)"]},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdCue","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" places the break: "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".preRoll"},{"type":"text","text":" before the content, "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".midRoll(seconds)"},{"type":"text","text":" at a point"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on the content timeline, ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":".postRoll"},{"text":" after it. Listing several creatives in one break plays","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"them back to back as a pod. Creatives with unusable URLs are dropped.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdBreak\/skipAfter","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" sets how many seconds must play before the break can be skipped, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdBreak\/maxDuration","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" caps the break. "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/scheduled"},{"type":"text","text":" reads back what is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"currently scheduled, and "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/clearSchedule()"},{"type":"text","text":" drops it — though a break already"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"on screen plays to its end.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"name":"Note","style":"note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"Schedules are per content item. Re-apply them after","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRPlayerManager\/switchContent(to:_:)"},{"text":"; see ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/ContentSwitching"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"type":"aside"},{"text":"Immersive Creatives","anchor":"Immersive-Creatives","level":3,"type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A creative renders as a flat 2D panel by default. Pass ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdCreative\/geometry"},{"text":" for a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"creative authored for an immersive geometry, and the surface switches for that creative and is","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"restored to the content’s geometry when the break ends:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["YBVRAdCreative(urlString: sphericalAdURL, geometry: .nsEquirectangularMono)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"anchor":"Observing-Ad-Playback","level":2,"type":"heading","text":"Observing Ad Playback"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/playback","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" carries a ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdPlayback"},{"type":"text","text":" while an ad is on screen and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"nil"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"while content plays — the simplest signal for “am I in an ad right now”:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["player.ads.playback","    .receive(on: DispatchQueue.main)","    .sink { [weak self] playback in","        self?.adPlayback = playback","        self?.isPlayingAd = playback != nil","    }","    .store(in: &cancellables)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdPlayback","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" names the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdBreak","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", the ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdCreative","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" on screen, and its index","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"within the pod — enough to render “Ad 2 of 3”.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/didBegin","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/didEnd"},{"type":"text","text":" fire once per break for"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"one-shot work such as hiding your transport controls:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["player.ads.didBegin","    .receive(on: DispatchQueue.main)","    .sink { [weak self] _ in self?.hideControls() }","    .store(in: &cancellables)"]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Progress and Skipping","anchor":"Progress-and-Skipping"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/position","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" and ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/duration","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"text":" track progress through the ad","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"on screen, in seconds, and are zero outside a break. Progress is break-relative when the break","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"declares a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"maxDuration"},{"type":"text","text":" and creative-relative otherwise."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Drive a skip button from "},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/canSkip"},{"text":" and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/skipAvailableIn","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":", and call","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/cancelCurrentBreak()","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" to act on it:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing","code":["if vm.canSkipAd {","    Button(\"Skip Ad\") { player.ads.cancelCurrentBreak() }","} else {","    Text(\"Skip in \\(Int(vm.skipAvailableIn))s\")","}"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"cancelCurrentBreak()"},{"type":"text","text":" abandons the break and resumes the content where it was interrupted —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"no content is skipped. It returns "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"text":" when refused because the break’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"skipAfter"},{"type":"text","text":" offset"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has not elapsed, so the offset holds even if your own button says otherwise. Binding the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"button’s enabled state to "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"canSkip"},{"type":"text","text":" keeps the two in step."}]},{"level":3,"type":"heading","text":"Seeks and Missed Mid-Rolls","anchor":"Seeks-and-Missed-Mid-Rolls"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Interstitials fire when playback "},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"crosses","type":"text"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" a cue point, so a seek can jump over one. By"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default the SDK plays the mid-roll guarding the segment the playhead landed in — the last"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"mid-roll cue at or before the new position, if it has not already played. Turn that off with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/playsMissedMidRollsOnSeek","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":":"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["player.ads.playsMissedMidRollsOnSeek = false"],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/isPreparing","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" is "},{"code":"true","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" while an ad re-armed by a seek is being fetched but"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"has not yet reached the screen — a good cue for a brief spinner."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/playedIds","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":" reports the breaks that have already played or been skipped,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"which is what you need to draw timeline markers that distinguish consumed breaks from"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"upcoming ones."}]},{"anchor":"Resuming-a-Session-on-Another-Player","type":"heading","level":3,"text":"Resuming a Session on Another Player"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Which breaks have played lives in the manager that played them, and a schedule is armed"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"against the content that manager opened. Resuming the same content on a "},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"new"}],"type":"emphasis"},{"type":"text","text":" manager —"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"swapping the rendering surface — therefore starts with an empty history: the pre-roll is armed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"again, and restoring the playhead seeks over the mid-rolls already watched, which the catch-up"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"above reads as a viewer skipping them."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Carry the ids across and hand them over before the new manager opens its stream:"}]},{"code":["let seen = oldPlayer.ads.playedIds.value","\/\/ …build the new manager…","newPlayer.ads.markPlayed(seen)"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/markPlayed(_:)","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" drops those breaks from the schedule and takes them out of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the seek catch-up. It is cleared when the manager moves on to new content, so a genuine"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"content switch still plays its ads. See "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/SwitchingPlayerMode","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"references":{"doc://applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK/documentation/YBVRAppleSDK/YBVRAdController/markPlayed(_:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/applesdk.YBVRAppleSDK\/documentation\/YBVRAppleSDK\/YBVRAdController\/markPlayed(_:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"markPlayed(_:)","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"markPlayed","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Sh","text":"Set","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"kind":"text","text":"<"},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"String","preciseIdentifier":"s:SS"},{"text":">)","kind":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/ybvrapplesdk\/ybvradcontr